{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-o069a","title":"吕蒙前锋斩陈就","accounts":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-o069a-account","label":"《周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传》正文","text":"黄祖遣陈就水军出战，吕蒙勒前锋斩陈就。","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o069a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"lu-meng","role":"斩将","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o069a-q"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0040","role":"战死","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o069a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"是岁（承征黄祖记事）","precision":"relative","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o069a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhouyu-e-o069a-q","source_order":[54,317,"O069a"],"order":9681}],"persons":[{"id":"zhouyu-p0040","name":"陈就","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o069"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhouyu-m-o069-zhouyu-p0040","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o069"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-o069a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-c5dafa5a24682c296ffa","layer":"original","quote":"从征黄祖，祖令都督陈就，逆以水军出战。蒙勒前锋〖15〗，亲枭就首；","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":316,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o069","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-c5dafa5a24682c296ffa","layer":"original","quote":"从征黄祖，祖令都督陈就，逆以水军出战。蒙勒前锋〖15〗，亲枭就首；将士乘胜，进攻其城。祖闻就死，委城走，兵追擒之。权曰：“事之克，由陈就先获也。”以蒙为横野中郎将〖16〗，赐钱千万。是岁，又与周瑜、程普等，西破曹公于乌林，围曹仁于南郡。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":316,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
